s=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\vec I,\\alpha,M_\\alpha,\\Gamma_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\delta,\\vec I,\\alpha,M_\\alpha,\\Gamma_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S(\\vec I,\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S(\\vec I,\\delta)\\)</span> (typed iteration-system predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathbb P_\\alpha}\">\\(1_{\\mathbb P_\\alpha}\\)</span> is the greatest condition of the stage forcing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathbb P_\\alpha\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> (properness and forcing-relation predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (intermediate-model and forcing-order predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S(\\vec I,\\delta)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\;\\exists M_\\alpha,\\Gamma_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M_\\alpha,\\Gamma_\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\bigl(M_\\alpha,1_{\\mathbb P_\\alpha},\\ulcorner\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(v_0)\\urcorner,\\langle\\dot{\\mathbb Q}_\\alpha\\rangle,\\mathbb P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S(\\vec I,\\delta)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\;\\exists M_\\alpha,\\Gamma_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M_\\alpha,\\Gamma_\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\bigl(M_\\alpha,1_{\\mathbb P_\\alpha},\\ulcorner\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(v_0)\\urcorner,\\langle\\dot{\\mathbb Q}_\\alpha\\rangle,\\mathbb P_\\alpha,\\leq_\\alpha\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P_\\delta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each stage hypothesis supplies the ground model and order required by the canonical six-place forcing relation; the former four-place call was ill-typed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f578666c473032f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"8571507e654b3ca0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.